&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dwbfhi&quot; data-start=&quot;1443&quot; data-end=&quot;1597&quot;&gt;Support coordination and execution of Home Health Aide training programs, including scheduling, materials management, and skills practice coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10lmkwq&quot; data-start=&quot;1598&quot; data-end=&quot;1663&quot;&gt;Maintain and update required federal and state labor postings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jbm39f&quot; data-start=&quot;1746&quot; data-end=&quot;1801&quot;&gt;Perform additional duties as assigned by supervisor&lt;/li&gt;
