&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bbyfce&quot; data-start=&quot;1986&quot; data-end=&quot;2035&quot;&gt;Strong interpersonal and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1q7jpcf&quot; data-start=&quot;2036&quot; data-end=&quot;2095&quot;&gt;Excellent organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kgdvdl&quot; data-start=&quot;2096&quot; data-end=&quot;2160&quot;&gt;Basic computer proficiency required to perform job functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16s761u&quot; data-start=&quot;2228&quot; data-end=&quot;2335&quot;&gt;Demonstrates &lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Core Values: Compassion, Excellence, and Reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
