&lt;p&gt;· Liaise with. Various departments to ensure optimum VIP Player journeys and processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Work closely with VIP Director, Marketing and Commercial Teams to create track and report on monthly and quarterly execution plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Regular meetings with internal VIP Operations Team and Stakeholders to drive new launches and projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Deliver against company responsible gaming protocols.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Develop and track budgets with VIP Team to ensure fair use of player entertainment budgets for retail.&lt;/p&gt;
